{"id":"d_main_44_01","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch44","label":"Chapter 44 · Path"},"label":"To Eden","stage":"44-3 STAGE · Start","prev":null,"next":"d_main_44_02","speakers":{"anis_i":"Anis","rapi_red":"Rapi"},"icons":{"anis_i":"si_c017_00_s","rapi_red":"si_c016_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_44_01_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_1","text":"Man, it feels like it's been forever since we came up to the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CityForest_03_d","bgArt":"cityforest_03_d","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_beforethenextstep","movie":null,"shown":["anis_i","rapi_red"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_2","text":"And surprise surprise: I still don't miss it, and I still don't enjoy it one bit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_3","text":"Is everything going to be okay with that expansive armament... Star, was it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_4","text":"Yeah.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_5","text":"Do you know how to operate it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_6","text":"Uh... not really. I still haven't got a clue what it can really do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_7","text":"Boss said it can absorb optical weapons and control them, but I can't really wrap my head around that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_8","text":"I have no idea how to do that...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_9","text":"And optical weapons cost a fortune, so testing it in the Ark is out of the question.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_10","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_11","text":"... Why don't we go to Eden and ask them to use one of their weapons?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_12","text":"What, you want them to shoot a laser at me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_13","text":"Yeah. I bet they're good with optical weapons.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_14","text":"Actually... that makes sense.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_15","text":"They've got that rich, fancy-schmancy vibe about 'em. I can totally see them using optical weapons like they're no big deal.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_16","text":"All right then, let's go and get as much help from them as we can.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_17","text":"Yeah, it's not like we're strangers to them. There's no harm in asking.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_18","text":"I should snag some fruit while we're there, too. They have the best fruit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_19","text":"... I wonder why they suddenly reached out to me, though.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_20","text":"They didn't tell you anything?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_21","text":"No, all they said was to get there quickly...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_22","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_23","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_24","text":"That sounds ominous.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_25","text":"Yeah, something tells me they're not inviting us over for a party.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_26","text":"Did Deputy Chief Andersen say anything?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_27","text":"Not really. He just told me to head over.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_28","text":"Perhaps he's overwhelmed by all the intel we brought back.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_29","text":"Probably.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_30","text":"The Four Beasts created a new Queen,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_31","text":"then they all somehow ended up on our side.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_32","text":"Even I couldn't make sense of it when I first heard it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_33","text":"You don't think information about the Queen—our child, I mean—will get back to the Central Government, do you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_34","text":"... Huh? What child?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_35","text":"Hmm... I think it'll be fine. The deputy chief said he'd only share it with a small group.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_36","text":"I sure hope so.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_37","text":"Hold up, did I hear that right? Did you just say something about a child?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_38","text":"Heh...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_39","text":"Anis, I need you to listen carefully, and promise not to freak out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_40","text":"You must remain calm, no matter what.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_41","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_42","text":"The Commander and I... We—","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_43","text":"H-hey! Wanna see a Vapaus bullet? The tip is all sparkly! It's really cool.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_44","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_44","text":"I quickly pull out the Vapaus bullet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_45","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_45","text":"The crimson bullet glints in the light.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_46","text":"... Why are you suddenly showing that to us?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_47","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_47","text":"C-cause it's awesome! Wow, look at it!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_48","text":"Yeah... Really awesome... But, uh...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_49","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_50","text":"Why are you looking at me like that, Rapi?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_51","text":"Nothing. It's nothing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_52","text":"Don't give me that. What is it? You're definitely giving me a look.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_53","text":"It's like you've got the words \"I win\" written on your face.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_54","text":"I said it's nothing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_55","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_56","text":"So this is the Vapaus bullet you got from Ingrid. That's reassuring.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_57","text":"Hey! Don't dodge the question...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_58","text":"It's a shame that it's only one round.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_59","text":"Okay, fine! But I'm gonna figure out why you're acting like this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_60","text":"Sometimes, ignorance is bliss.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_61","text":"Oh yeah? We'll see about that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_62","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_63","text":"Commander, don't they need your blood to make more of these?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_64","text":"Did they take some from you again?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_65","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_65","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_66","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_66","text":"They did, but it didn't really work.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_67","text":"What do you mean?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_68","text":"Don't tell me you're afraid of needles, Commander...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_69","text":"Nah, that can't be it. Only a kid would be afraid of needles, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_70","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_70","text":"The needle wouldn't go in.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_71","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_72","text":"... Huh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_73","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_73","text":"The needle just wouldn't go in. Or rather, the moment it did, the puncture it made would close back up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_74","text":"Your gene...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_75","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_75","text":"It wasn't ever this extreme, certainly not before we encountered the Four Beasts.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_76","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_44_01_76","text":"Hmm... Actually, that might've been when it started, seeing how I survived that fall.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_44_01_77",